        "images": false,
        "networks": true,
        "volumes": true,
        "tempdir": true
      },
      "notes": "FR-040 reference-lenient class for `exec`: the reference accepts a wrongly-typed `forwardPorts`, creates the container and then execs into it successfully; deacon refuses the document and never reaches the container. Same fixture, same waiver, one stage further along than the `up` case — which is the evidence that the leniency is not a read-time quirk."
    },
